<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sondor yr headline shr slides, no div.</title>
<headline>Sondor yr headline shr slides, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - headline		16.42	 vs 22.75</p>
<p>    - attrib		  14.79	 vs 21.77</p>
<p>    After tax profit	3.55	  vs 5.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   5.76	  vs 7.74</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.21	  vs 2.51</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   0.50	  vs 1.20</p>
<p>    Turnover		  58.82	 vs 52.29</p>
<p>Full name: Sondor Industries Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said that strategic investments were made during the current financial year which impacted on profitability but will ensure that the group is well placed to meet future demand.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
